               clustering and assignment options. SimpleMetaPipeline accepts
               demultiplexed paired‐end and single reads from multiple
               sequencing runs. We describe the pipeline and demonstrate how
               alternative annotations enable the easy implementation of
               multi‐algorithm agreement tests to strengthen inferences.
               SimpleMetaPipeline represents a valuable addition to the existing
               library of pipelines, providing easy and reproducible
               bioinformatics, including a range of commonly desired clustering
               and assignment options, such as OTUs and ASVs.",
  month     =  "1~" # nov,
  year      =  2024,
  keywords  = "amplicon sequence variants; bioinformatics pipeline; eDNA;
